  "ruleText": "Rev 701.22 “Signature” means a signature as provided in Rev 2904.04 or an electronic signature as provided in Rev 2904.05.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Rev 701) originally #5399, eff 5-21-92; ss and moved by #6750, eff 5-19-98 (from Rev 701.24); moved by #6870 (from Rev 701.25), eff 10-20-98; ss by #8653, eff 6-8-06; ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 701.23); renumbered by #12184 (from Rev 701.25); ss by #12907, eff 10-23-19; ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34 (formerly Rev 701.26)",
